// Title: Suspicious Driver Install by pnputil.exe
// ID: a2ea3ae7-d3d0-40a0-a55c-25a45c87cac1
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Hai Vaknin @LuxNoBulIshit, Avihay eldad  @aloneliassaf, Austin Songer @austinsonger
// Date: 2021-09-30
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1547
// Description: Detects when a possible suspicious driver is being installed via pnputil.exe lolbin
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((process.command_line like "*_-i*" or process.command_line like "*_/install*" or process.command_line like "*_-a*" or process.command_line like "*_/add-driver*" or process.command_line like "*_.inf*") and process.executable endswith "\\pnputil.exe")
